## Installation

```bash
pip install torch>=1.9.0
pip install numpy>=1.20.0
pip install scipy>=1.7.0
pip install scikit-learn>=0.24.0
pip install loguru>=0.5.3
pip install optuna>=2.10.0
pip install tqdm>=4.60.0
```

